  "notes": "Seated reading from the owner's own videos. Book on the lap; the left hand holds the left cover's outer edge, the right hand rests on the right page, fingertips down. Two page turns (4.0-6.8 s and 11.5-14.3 s): fingers land spread, tips draw in to the thumb (pinch), the hand lifts and carries the page all the way over, lays it on the left page and holds it ~0.6 s, then flicks open and comes back. Hand skin checked out of the book every 0.1 s. pages[]: a thin box hinged on the spine: put a group at 'pivot', inside it the page with 'rot' (deg, XYZ) and its left edge on the pivot (box spans local x 0..size[0]); rotate the group about 'axis' by keys=[[t_s, deg]] (linear, 30 fps; 0 = lying on the right half, -160 = on the left half). Optional paper bend: split it into 'strips' along x, each hinge bent by bend*sin(pi*|deg|/160)/(strips-1) deg about local y. Approved by the owner."
 },
